    "1. Tap Open Shortcuts below and create a new shortcut.\n2. Add the “Open App” action and choose %1$@.\n3. Name the shortcut exactly “%1$@”, then come back and tap Test launch." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Tap Open Shortcuts below and create a new shortcut.\n2. Add the “Open App” action and choose %1$@.\n3. Name the shortcut exactly “%1$@”, then come back and tap Test launch."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. 点击下方“打开快捷指令”，新建一个快捷指令。\n2. 添加“打开 App”操作并选择 %1$@。\n3. 将快捷指令命名为“%1$@”，然后回来点击“测试启动”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. 點按下方「打開捷徑」，新增一個捷徑。\n2. 加入「打開 App」動作並選擇 %1$@。\n3. 將捷徑命名為「%1$@」，然後回來點按「測試啟動」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
